WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:16.099
Tom stared at his wand.

2
00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:19.539
It was still sinking into the mud.

3
00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:36.736
He reached in to pull it out . . . and tumbled backwards!

4
00:00:36.737 --> 00:00:39.922
Tom sat down on a log.

5
00:00:39.923 --> 00:00:43.426
"This is terrible," he thought.

6
00:00:43.427 --> 00:00:46.705
"Princess Mary needs me!

7
00:00:46.706 --> 00:00:52.056
What am I going to do?"

8
00:00:52.057 --> 00:00:55.989
Cat dashed around the Royal Kitchen.

9
00:00:55.990 --> 00:01:00.865
She was chasing a mouse.

10
00:01:00.866 --> 00:01:04.635
Suddenly Cat stopped.

11
00:01:04.636 --> 00:01:08.074
She heard Cook talking to a servant.

12
00:01:08.075 --> 00:01:13.090
"Dirk sent Tom into the Dark Forest," Cook said.

13
00:01:13.091 --> 00:01:17.106
"He told Tom the tale of the pinkberry bush.

14
00:01:17.107 --> 00:01:20.810
He said it was the princess' only hope."

15
00:01:20.811 --> 00:01:23.681
"Oh no!" the servant said.

16
00:01:23.682 --> 00:01:27.025
"Tom will get lost in the Dark Forest.

17
00:01:27.026 --> 00:01:29.362
He'll never come back!"

18
00:01:29.363 --> 00:01:35.066
Cook nodded. "And the poor princess . . ."

19
00:01:35.067 --> 00:01:39.914
Cat didn't wait to hear anymore.

20
00:01:39.915 --> 00:01:49.074
She raced out of the palace.

21
00:01:49.075 --> 00:01:51.975
Tom looked around the forest.

22
00:01:51.976 --> 00:01:58.180
"Where is that pinkberry bush?"

23
00:01:58.181 --> 00:02:02.344
Crunch! Snap! Crunch! Snap!

24
00:02:02.345 --> 00:02:07.003
He heard more strange noises.

25
00:02:07.004 --> 00:02:10.689
Then Cat appeared!

26
00:02:10.690 --> 00:02:14.723
"I'm so glad to see you, Cat!" Tom cried.

27
00:02:14.724 --> 00:02:17.771
"I'm looking for the pinkberry bush!"

28
00:02:17.772 --> 00:02:19.955
Cat shook her head.

29
00:02:19.956 --> 00:02:22.625
"It's just a tale, Tom.

30
00:02:22.626 --> 00:02:26.160
Pinkberries only grow in the spring."

31
00:02:26.161 --> 00:02:29.109
"But . . ." Tom blinked.

32
00:02:29.110 --> 00:02:32.243
"Princess Mary is very sick.

33
00:02:32.244 --> 00:02:42.127
If I don't find some pinkberries, she might die!"
